// Place layout blocks for town layout v2 (DEC-090, TOWN_GENERATION.md §6.3).
// Stage B adds these `layout` blocks to the entries of
// content/base/places.jsonc (by `key`), unchanged in shape; stage A keeps
// them on the client.
//
// slot: civic | square | works | community | commercial | green | harbour.
// footprint: [[min w, min h], [max w, max h]], tiles; the generator tries the
// largest first. place: placement predicates in order of preference
// (on_square, near_square, central, edge, toward:minerals, toward:woods,
// by_water, shore, riverbank, near_rail, high_ground, largest_residential,
// quiet). signature: the landmark silhouette prop; with: companion features
// the plan reserves (spoil_heap, rail_spur, winding_house, stalls, pier,
// cranes, chimney).
